#: ../../../source/examples/notebooks/performance/02-input-parameters.ipynb:19
msgid ""
"An obvious question is how can we efficiently re-run simulations with "
"different parameters (step 1 in the pipeline)? Ideally we'd like to do this "
"without having to re-build the model and discretisation each time, which as "
"we've seen is a costly process."
